# rsync prefs: copy next to the app and rename to "rsync prefs".
# Uncomment and edit examples, or define any names you choose.
# There are no predefined options: each NAME = value supplies $(NAME)
# in a command. Names are case-sensitive.
# SRV = 192.168.1.10
# MODULE = src
# SOURCE = rsync://192.168.1.10/src/
# DEST = :MyApp:
#
# Example command: rsync -av $(SOURCE) $(DEST)
# These are substitutions, not environment variables. Use the console
# command "set NAME=VALUE" to set an environment variable instead.
